<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Listen to the wondrous story</l><l>Which they chant in hymns of joy:</l><l>“Glory in the highest, glory!</l><l>Glory be to God most high!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>“Peace on earth, good-will from heaven,</l><l>Reaching far as man is found;</l><l>Souls redeemed and sins forgiven,</l><l>Loud our golden harps shall sound.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>“Christ is born! the great Anointed!</l><l>Heaven and earth His glory sing;</l><l>Oh, receive whom God appointed</l><l>For your Prophet, Priest, and King!</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>“Hasten, mortals, to adore Him,</l><l>Learn His name and taste His joy,</l><l>Till one day ye sing before Him</l><l>Glory be to God most high!”</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Let us learn the wondrous story</l><l>Of our great Redeemer’s birth;</l><l>Spread the brightness of His glory,</l><l>Till it cover all the earth.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
